# Workspace Boundary

You can’t delete or add files outside of `/Users/vedantsubramanian/Documents/Harish/AgenticAI_Projects/AgenticDataGov`.

## Rules

- Create, edit, and delete files **only** under `/Users/vedantsubramanian/Documents/Harish/AgenticAI_Projects/AgenticDataGov`.
- Refuse any path that resolves outside that folder (absolute paths elsewhere, `..` traversal, symlinks out of tree).
- Do not write to `~/.cursor/skills-cursor`, other projects, or home-directory configs unless the user explicitly asks and the path is still inside the project folder.
- Reads outside the folder for reference are allowed; mutations are not.

## Examples

```text
